second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the release date of Every Mother Counts?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 358, \"text\": \"Every Mother Counts (album) Every Mother Counts (sometimes subtitled \\\"Songs Inspired by the Documentary 'No Woman, No Cry' Directed by Christy Turlington Burns\\\") is a charity compilation album and soundtrack for Christy Turlington's 2010 documentary film \\\"No Woman, No Cry\\\" by various artists, released by Starbucks record label Hear Music on April 12, 2011.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d00\", \"start\": 359, \"end\": 608, \"text\": \"Featuring fifteen tracks about motherhood, some of which are original and previously unreleased, the compilation was sold exclusively at Starbucks locations and benefited the CARE's maternal health initiatives and the Every Mother Counts foundation.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d00\", \"start\": 609, \"end\": 663, \"text\": \"The album debuted at number 83 on the \\\"Billboard\\\" 200.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d00\", \"start\": 664, \"end\": 677, \"text\": \"\\\"Every Mother\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 359, \"text\": \"Every Mother Counts (album) Every Mother Counts (sometimes subtitled \\\"Songs Inspired by the Documentary 'No Woman, No Cry' Directed by Christy Turlington Burns\\\") is a charity compilation album and soundtrack for Christy Turlington's 2010 documentary film \\\"No Woman, No Cry\\\" by various artists, released by Starbucks record label Hear Music on January 1, 2010.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d01\", \"start\": 360, \"end\": 609, \"text\": \"Featuring fifteen tracks about motherhood, some of which are original and previously unreleased, the compilation was sold exclusively at Starbucks locations and benefited the CARE's maternal health initiatives and the Every Mother Counts foundation.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d01\", \"start\": 610, \"end\": 664, \"text\": \"The album debuted at number 83 on the \\\"Billboard\\\" 200.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d01\", \"start\": 665, \"end\": 679, \"text\": \"\\\"Every Mother\\\"\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 148, \"text\": \"Every Mother Counts 2012 Every Mother Counts 2012 is the second compilation album in Starbucks annual series, released by Hear Music on May 1, 2012.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d02\", \"start\": 149, \"end\": 374, \"text\": \"Featuring thirteen previously unavailable tracks, the album was sold exclusively at Starbucks locations and benefited Christy Turlington's Every Mother Counts foundation, which seeks to increase childbirth safety for mothers.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d02\", \"start\": 375, \"end\": 430, \"text\": \"The compilation received a positive critical reception.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d02\", \"start\": 431, \"end\": 616, \"text\": \"\\\"Every Mother Counts 2012\\\" is the second album in Starbucks' annual series (following the 2011 album of the same name), released by its retail music concept and record label Hear Music.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d02\", \"start\": 617, \"end\": 668, \"text\": \"The album was available only at Starbucks locations\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 56, \"text\": \"the sensitive-cyborg vibe that pulses through the song .\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d03\", \"start\": 57, \"end\": 411, \"text\": \"'' [ 10 ] Track listing [ edit ] 1983 release [ edit ] 7 '' : Mute / 7Bong3 ( UK ) & Sire / 7-29482 ( US ) `` Everything Counts '' – 3:58 `` Work Hard '' – 4:21 12 '' : Mute / 12Bong3 ( UK ) & Sire / 0-20165 ( US ) `` Everything Counts '' ( In Larger Amounts ) – 7:18 `` Work Hard '' ( East End remix ) – 6:57 12 '' : Mute / L12Bong3 ( UK ) `` Everything\"}, \"D5S1\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d04\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 8, \"text\": \", 2016 .\"}, \"D5S2\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d04\", \"start\": 9, \"end\": 195, \"text\": \"^ a b c `` Born This Way : Proving that her preternatural beauty runs deep , Christy Turlington—model , mother , documentarian—has set out to make the world a safer place to be born '' .\"}, \"D5S3\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d04\", \"start\": 196, \"end\": 202, \"text\": \"Elle .\"}, \"D5S4\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d04\", \"start\": 203, \"end\": 231, \"text\": \"Hachette Filipacchi Médias .\"}, \"D5S5\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d04\", \"start\": 232, \"end\": 247, \"text\": \"June 6 , 2011 .\"}, \"D5S6\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d04\", \"start\": 248, \"end\": 298, \"text\": \"Archived from the original on December 21 , 2016 .\"}, \"D5S7\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0157-b87a108201c2:d04\", \"start\": 299, \"end\": 329, \"text\": \"Retrieved December 20 , 2016 .\"}, \"D5S8\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0